J/ApJS/219/4    S4G pipeline 4: multi-component decompositions    (Salo+, 2015)
================================================================================
The Spitzer Survey of Stellar Structure in Galaxies (S^4^G):
multi-component decomposition strategies and data release.
    Salo H., Laurikainen E., Laine J., Comeron S., Gadotti D.A., Buta R.,
    Sheth K., Zaritsky D., Ho L., Knapen J., Athanassoula E., Bosma A.,
    Laine S., Cisternas M., Kim T., Munoz-Mateos J.C., Regan M., Hinz J.L.,
    Gil de Paz A., Menendez-Delmestre K., Mizusawa T., Erroz-Ferrer S.,
    Meidt S.E., Querejeta M.
   <Astrophys. J. Suppl. Ser., 219, 4 (2015)>
   =2015ApJS..219....4S
